### VS Code REST Client examples for Organizer API
# Requires the app running on http://localhost:8082

### 1) List organizers (auto public URLs on ownEvents[].images and organizer.image)
GET http://localhost:8082/organizers
Accept: application/json

### 2) Get organizer by id
GET http://localhost:8082/organizers/1
Accept: application/json

### 3) Create organizer (image can be object key or full URL)
POST http://localhost:8082/organizers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Organizer",
  "image": "organizers/sample.png"
}

### 4) Upload image (get key + URL)
POST http://localhost:8082/uploadImage
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

# Use VS Code REST Client 'file' syntax
# image=@/absolute/path/to/your.png
